## [2026-10-31 16:45] 手部识别（手指），面板开关，绑定到 3D 小人
- **Goal**: 识别更细致的动作（手指），在面板加开关，并让小人的手跟着动
- **Changes**: 新增 `public/mediapipe/hand_landmarker.task`（float16 v1）；新增 `src/pose/hands.js`（加载 Hand Landmarker、按姿态手腕把检测到的手分到左右并按镜像映射、握拳程度 gripOf、手掌横轴用于手腕转动、手势 握拳 / 张开 / 比 V / 点赞 / 指、在摄像头浮窗画 21 点手指骨架）；`engine/camera.js`：开关时懒加载模型、同帧检测、开启时摄像头请求 1280×720 并在切换时重启；`pose/camera.js`：`camSolve` 用手掌横轴决定拇指点（手腕转动）并输出 `sol.grip`；`render/hand.js`：`applyFist` 支持左右手分别握拳；`render/stage.js`：每只手的握拳 = max(哑铃, 识别到的握拳)；`engine/engine.js`：`setHands`、`S.handG`（手势文字）；`useEngine.js` 暴露 `handG`；`CamPreview.vue` 标题栏显示手势；`stores/settings.js` 新增 `camHands`（`stick.camHands`，默认关）；`CameraTuning.vue` 手部识别开关与说明；`App.vue` 启动时应用；`i18n/messages.js` 日英翻译；`CLAUDE.md` 同步。lint、build 通过；Node 测试握拳 / 张开 / 比 V / 指 / 点赞与镜像分手；无头 Chromium 验证开关、720p 切换、手部模型加载、无报错

## [2026-10-31 16:50] Body tracking misalignment: high-accuracy model + 2D/3D fusion
- **Goal**: The figure's limbs were misaligned with the person ("错位"). Use MediaPipe's heavy pose model and take limb x / y from the image landmarks instead of the regressed world landmarks.
- **Changes**: `public/mediapipe/pose_landmarker_heavy.task` (new); `src/pose/camera.js` (`fuse2d`, `POSE_MODELS`, `loadLandmarker(model)`, `cam.aspect` / `cam.s2d`); `src/engine/camera.js` (`loadPose`, `setModel`); `src/engine/engine.js` (`setPoseModel`); `src/stores/settings.js` (`camModel`, `stick.camModel`); `src/components/drawer/CameraTuning.vue` (识别精度 高精度 / 标准); `src/App.vue`; `src/i18n/messages.js`; `CLAUDE.md`.

## [2026-10-31 17:30] Rigged body models (Xbot, Michelle) with a panel switch
- **Goal**: Use the user's two rigged Mixamo models (with finger bones) as switchable bodies, fingers driven by hand tracking.
- **Changes**: `public/models/xbot.glb`, `public/models/michelle.glb` (new); `src/render/glbSkin.js` (new, `parseSkinnedGlb`); `src/render/riggedModel.js` (new, `createRiggedModel`); `src/render/stage.js` (`BODY_URL`, `setBody`, `mapP`, per-finger smoothing); `src/render/particles.js` (`makeBody`, `use`, `procedural`); `src/render/bodyModel.js` (`activate`, `frame`, `gripOf`); `src/pose/hands.js` (`curlOf`, `curl`); `src/pose/camera.js` (`sol.fingers`); `src/core/skeleton.js` (Solved typedef); `src/engine/engine.js` (`setBody`, overlay via `mapP`); `src/stores/settings.js` (`body`); `src/components/drawer/DisplayOptions.vue`, `DataNotes.vue`; `src/App.vue`; `src/i18n/messages.js`; `CLAUDE.md`.

## [2026-10-31 17:20] Camera figure stands upright (tilt levelling)
- **Goal**: A tilted camera made the whole figure lean; level the pose so the body is perpendicular to the floor.
- **Changes**: `src/pose/camera.js` (`measureVertical`, `levelRot`, `levelOf`, `cam.vert`, `camSolve` levelling); `CLAUDE.md`.

## [2026-10-31 17:35] Rigged models: no hand flip at the top of a curl
- **Goal**: The pinky side of the hand flipped up in the last frames of a curl (the thumb direction lines up with the forearm near 90° of elbow bend and then crosses).
- **Changes**: `src/render/riggedModel.js` (hand role: blend towards the frame carried from the forearm by how far the thumb stands off, keep the thumb side continuous frame to frame).
